<Base title="Bodybuilding — FANNYMAGNET" description="Bodybuilding culture, training, recovery and the science of adaptation."><main class="page"><a class="back" href="/">← FANNYMAGNET</a><p class="kicker">BODYBUILDING / CULTURE</p><h1>The body was never just a body.</h1><p class="intro">Training is biology, ritual, identity and archive. Read the culture with curiosity, and the claims with care.</p><section><h2>Adaptation is the story.</h2><p>Muscle growth emerges from repeated training, adequate nutrition, recovery and time. We examine the evidence without reducing people to a before-and-after image.</p></section><a class="cta" href="/journal">READ THE JOURNAL ↗</a></main></Base>
